---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Experience"
  description="Experience — Nasiya Pervez: MSc Operations Research & Business Analytics, global talent and sales experience with a supply chain lens."
>
  <section class="page-head reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Experience</p>
    <h1>A journey toward supply chain, built on data</h1>
    <p class="lede">Scratch below and the through-line is a single idea: pipelines, demand, capacity, and optimization — whether they belong to hiring, sales, or logistics.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section timeline">
    <!-- MASTERS -->
    <article class="entry reveal" style="--d: 0.05s">
      <div class="entry-line">
        <span class="entry-dot"></span>
        <time>2024 – 2026</time>
      </div>
      <div class="entry-card">
        <div class="entry-head">
          <h3>MSc Operations Research & Business Analytics</h3>
          <p class="entry-scope">Otto von Guericke University · Magdeburg, Germany</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Graduate focus on optimization, simulation, and decision support — the methods behind logistics and planning.</li>
          <li>Coursework in Databases (SQL), AI-Based Decision Support I & II, Sustainable Supply Chain Management, Simulation in Production & Logistics, and Optimization Implementation.</li>
          <li>Built applied work in demand and workforce planning under uncertainty.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="maps-to">Maps to supply chain because&nbsp;<span>this is the exact toolkit used for logistics analytics, demand planning, and supply chain optimization.</span></p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- TALENT ACQUISITION -->
    <article class="entry reveal" style="--d: 0.1s">
      <div class="entry-line">
        <span class="entry-dot"></span>
        <time>Global Recruitment</time>
      </div>
      <div class="entry-card">
        <div class="entry-head">
          <h3>Talent Acquisition Specialist</h3>
          <p class="entry-scope">IdeasUnlimited · Latin America, US, Europe, Asia, South Africa</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Managed recruitment pipelines across five regions, forecasting hiring demand and aligning candidate supply to shifting business needs.</li>
          <li>Built data-driven sourcing and screening that improved candidate qualification and shortened time-to-fill.</li>
          <li>Turned ambiguous requirements from distributed stakeholders into defined, measurable hiring outcomes.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="maps-to">Maps to supply chain because&nbsp;<span>pipelines, lead times, capacity balancing, and demand forecasting are the same structural problem planners solve every day.</span></p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT -->
    <article class="entry reveal" style="--d: 0.15s">
      <div class="entry-line">
        <span class="entry-dot"></span>
        <time>International Sales</time>
      </div>
      <div class="entry-card">
        <div class="entry-head">
          <h3>Business Development Executive</h3>
          <p class="entry-scope">IdeasUnlimited · US-focused international client base</p>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Led international lead generation and qualification, using funnel and conversion analytics to prioritize opportunities.</li>
          <li>Negotiated and onboarded clients, mapping deal cycles and forecasting pipeline outcomes.</li>
          <li>Juggled accounts and deadlines with a structured, data-backed approach to prioritization.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="maps-to">Maps to supply chain because&nbsp;<span>sales forecasting, demand shaping, and pipeline management mirror S&amp;OP — same data, same decisions, different stage.</span></p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta reveal">
    <h2>Similar toolset, new stage</h2>
    <p>Now learning SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition to apply the same lens inside enterprise supply chains.</p>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Talk to me</a>
      <a href="/blog" class="btn btn-ghost">Read the blog</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .page-head {
      padding: 24px 0 8px;
    }

    .page-head h1 {
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    .lede {
      max-width: 680px;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      margin: 16px 0 8px;
    }

    /* ---------- Timeline ---------- */
    .timeline {
      position: relative;
      padding-top: 24px;
    }

    .entry {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .entry-line {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 2px;
      background: var(--border);
    }

    .entry-line::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: -4px;
      top: 24px;
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--emerald);
    }

    .entry-line time {
      position: absolute;
      left: 14px;
      top: -2px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--faint);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .entry-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 26px 28px;
      margin-left: 34px;
    }

    .entry-head h3 {
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .entry-scope {
      color: var(--faint);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .entry-card ul {
      padding-left: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .entry-card li {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .maps-to {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--faint);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 14px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .maps-to span {
      color: var(--emerald);
    }

    /* ---------- CTA ---------- */
    .cta {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 48px;
    }

    .cta p {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 620px) {
      .entry {
        padding-left: 16px;
      }

      .entry-card {
        margin-left: 18px;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .entry-line time {
        position: static;
        display: block;
        padding-left: 14px;
        margin-top: 4px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Base>